<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>OG</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/main.css">
<style>
  html, body { margin: 0; background: #F4F1EA; }
  .og { width: 1200px; height: 630px; padding: 64px 72px; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; color: #111110; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .og__top { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font: 500 15px/1 'Geist Mono', monospace; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #4E4B45; padding-bottom: 22px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(17,17,16,.16); }
  .og__title { font-family: 'Instrument Serif', serif; font-size: 118px; line-height: .94; letter-spacing: -0.025em; max-width: 14ch; }
  .og__title em { font-style: italic; }
  .og__bottom { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; font-family: 'Geist', sans-serif; font-size: 22px; color: #4E4B45; }
  .og__bottom b { color: #111110; font-weight: 500; display: block; font-size: 24px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .og__mark { width: 10px; height: 10px; background: #8B1E2D; transform: rotate(45deg); display: inline-block; margin-right: 14px; position: relative; top: -2px; }
</style></head>
<body>
<div class="og">
  <div class="og__top"><span>Matthew Shera — Game Director &amp; Systems Designer</span><span>matthewshera.com</span></div>
  <div class="og__title">Games that <em>earn</em> the years you give them.</div>
  <div class="og__bottom">
    <div><b><span class="og__mark"></span>Skyweaver · Pocket Knights · Don’t Die · SHIPLESS</b>Six years leading design on card and dice games. Toronto.</div>
  </div>
</div>
</body></html>
